      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so if it's making that noise during acceleration, does that mean the belt is slipping on the pulleys? i'm trying to figure out if it's just the belt itself that needs replacing or if something else is causing it to lose grip.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
